reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nPresent in 4.8 dev3\nNot present in 4.7.1 stable\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.8.dev3 - Linux Mint 22.3 (Zena) on X11 - X11 display driver, Multi-window, 2 monitors - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4090 (nvidia; 595.84) - AMD Ryzen 9 3900XT 12-Core Processor (24 threads) - 125.7 GiB memory - PulseAudio (44100 Hz, Stereo/mono)\n\n### Issue description\n\nIn 4.7.1 you get a red error message that explains that you have to enable \"vram_compression/import_etc2_astc\" when you want to export to macOS.\n\nIn 4.8 dev3 there is no warning but the \"export project\" button is disabled.\n\n4.8 dev3\n<img width=\"2039\" height=\"58\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ba674c24-4650-4955-a6cb-3120bb6ab2aa\" />\n\n4.7.1\n<img width=\"1229\" height=\"40\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1718d7b9-15b6-41f4-99c4-441f361c3711\" />\n\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nDisable \"vram_compression/import_etc2_astc\" and go into  project -> export. Make a macOS preset and download the proper template.\n\nResult: macOS cannot be exported. There is no warning.\n\nEnable \"vram_compression/import_etc2_astc\" and go into  project -> export. Project can be exportet.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A\nBehavior can be seen in brand new project.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}